  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refugee Resettlement to the Republic of Korea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to facilitate the resettlement of refugees from Malaysia to the Republic of Korea (ROK). The foreseen caseload is up to 50 refugees for the year. The Government of the Republic of Korea (GOK) requested IOM to continue to assist with refugee resettlement in 2022-2023, namely in pre-departure health assessment, pre-departure orientation and travel assistance prior to, during and after their journey to the ROK.</narrative>
  </description>
